  "memo": "SILICON LOOM - Rabbitoids, empire 2. Home: Zubeneschamali (380,20), hab 100%, NE corner, pop 37.9k, 10/37 factories and mines, 47 res/yr, surface minerals 442/379/468 - minerals are NOT a constraint, resources are.\n\nFUEL MODEL (measured, trust it): burn = mass x ly x 0.005 x warp. So w5=0.025, w6=0.030, w7=0.035, w8=0.040 per kT per ly. Consequences: Long Range Scout (mass 25, fuel 300) has 400 ly at w6, 343 ly at w7, 300 ly at w8. Spore Cloud loaded (mass 42, fuel 150) has ONE-WAY range 143 ly at w5, 119 ly at w6. Santa Maria (mass 95 loaded, fuel 200) only ~84 ly - Spore Cloud is the superior colonizer despite carrying 1000 vs 2500 colonists. Colonizers are one-way, so use the full one-way range; scouts must keep a reserve only if they need to return.\n\nDECISION 2103: scouts throttled UP from w6 to w7 on legs where fuel allows. w7 is 36% faster for 17% more fuel and discovery time is the binding constraint - 3 turns elapsed, 0 planets scanned. Nearest known star is 178 ly, so nothing could have been found yet; this is map geometry, not a broken scanner.\n\nSCOUT NET (4 hulls, +2 building): Armed Probe #1 -> Wolf 359 (arrives ~2104, FIRST SCAN) -> Shaula. LRS #6 -> Wolf 1061 (S, ~4 yr). LRS #7 -> (230,55) -> Groombridge 34 (NW). LRS #8 -> (330,120) -> (280,220) -> Rasalhague (central-SW corridor, sweeps the 100-200 ly band where a close target would hide).\n\nCOLONIZERS: Spore Cloud #1 returning home to refuel (53 fuel, 36 ly, w5 - makes it). #2/#3 idle at home, full tanks. RULE: no colonizer launches until a star is scanned habitable AND within its one-way range at the chosen warp. Wolf 359 at 178 ly is out of reach at w5-w6; it would need w3 (238 ly range, 20 years travel). If Wolf 359 scans green, the answer is Propulsion tech first, not a 20-year crawl.\n\nECONOMY: caps = pop/1000, rising ~4-5/turn. Queue = 2 scouts, then Factory x30, Mine x30. Re-queue every 3-4 turns. Research 30% Propulsion; hold there until Propulsion 1-2 lands (better engine = better range = expansion unlocked), then Energy -> Construction -> Weapons. Raise to 40-50% once factories reach cap.\n\nCONSTRUCTION GATE: only Packet / Salvage / Mini Mine Layer / Small Freighter / Midget Miner / Colony / Mini-Colony / Scout hulls buildable. No warship until Construction rises. Starbase options: Space Station, Orbital Fort.\n\nTHREAT: e1 Humanoids, 2 planets, rank 1, huge tech lead. Do not engage fleets. Stay Enemy so armed hulls return fire.\n\nNEXT TURN CHECKLIST: 1. Read Wolf 359 scan - habitable and <143 ly from any staging point? 2. Confirm Spore Cloud #1 refuelled. 3. Re-queue to new pop cap. 4. Re-issue a colonizer design if Propulsion levels up (harness auto-fits the best engine).",
